    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "small goals? rebuilding? how? there's nothing left to build with. i'm not just starting over, i'm starting from zero after two decades of pouring everything into a void. it's not like i can just \"find joy\" when the entire foundation of my life was a lie. it feels less like a \"mistake\" and more like the debt is just too high to ever pay back. i'm just tired of fighting a losing battle.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
